    <string name="editor_placeholders_text">“-s 0” is replaced with the selected SIM slot (the command runs once per slot).\n{{SAVED_MASK}} — the network mask saved before the mode was turned on.\n{{IMS_PACKAGES}} — IMS service packages currently used by the selected SIMs.\n\nOriginal values of “settings put” keys and packages disabled with “pm disable-user” are restored automatically when the mode is turned off.</string>
